## Requirements

- Python 3.11 recommended
- Packages pinned in `requirements.txt`
- A local web browser
- No cloud deployment or real hospital communication is required

## Scope limitation

This implementation demonstrates an academic workflow on a public dataset. Federated learning is simulated locally by partitioning the data into Hospital A, Hospital B, and Hospital C. It does not implement networking between hospitals, clinical validation, security hardening, or production deployment.
